  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8652;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#916;H</mi><mrow><mi>vap</mi><mo>.&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#916;n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mi>RT</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>41</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>373</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0959</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8771;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math></p>",
